<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ed99354 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="ed99354" data-settings='{"_animation":"fadeInUp"}' data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>CURE aims to create greater awareness about cancer – causes, prevention, symptoms, early detection, treatment, and rehabilitation. We play a pivotal role in patient and doctor education regarding symptoms and clinical signs of cancer.</p> </div>
