<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1f9f07d elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="1f9f07d" data-settings='{"_animation":"fadeInUp"}' data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>The future of oncology lies in research. CURE Foundation will undertake active scientific and clinical research. We will promote scientific exchange and knowledge dispersal by organizing conferences, seminars, and workshops. The foundation will update the medical fraternity of the latest techniques and intends to provide a comprehensive databank to help doctors dispel ambiguity inherent in cancer diagnosis and treatment.</p><p> </p> </div>
